    "photo": "Unknown0x508a62..0x508a94:top=unknownPaneTop+25,bottom=unknownPaneBottom-15. Standard0x508f3c..0x508f6b:top=bottom-125+25,bottom=bottom-15. Both85rows in125pane;local photo Y=100-100*C",
    "shoulderPaint": "0x509dc0..0x509eac:each positive-X shoulder stem from manually storedY to selected pane bottom;join the two shoulder Y points when both flags present",
    "centerPaint": "0x509cf4..0x509dc0 draws a full shared vertical marker then selected-pane horizontal readout mark and revalidates. This browser overlay projects center only on source-associated panes,not global nativecenterX/Ystate"
  },
  "implemented": [
    "Retained admitted measurement source/draft snapshot bound by exact FluxChoice identity,actual sourceID/hash/preparation;unknown/upper/lower overlays cannot migrate onto replaced sources",
    "Partial numeric/manual marks project on corresponding comparison panes;combined unknown photo+trace show same source/manual values in their own coordinate systems",
    "Photo Y=100-100*C,sampledY=125-100*C,printed browseraxisY=306-250*C;no visible-peak,gray,reverse or source-flux continuum inference",
    "Individual marks and continuum clipped geometrically to actual displaywindow/band,without clamping/deleting stored inputs;connector requires a complete correctly bracketed center/shoulder region",
    "Existing passive region prop retained for standalone renderer;native-style source selection remains explicit existing browser width selector;no direct comparison-pane editing added",
    "No scientific integrator,sampler,counts/seed,archive/JSON/CSV,grade,sourcebytes or resource additions"
  ],
  "remaining": [
